/Title (Life isn't always joyful, easy, or positive, and toxic positivity has no place here. True resilience means acknowledging adversity, struggle, heartbreak, and loss, and choosing to heal and let it fuel you rather than break you. You learn to transmute that heavy weight, turning raw pain into passion, purpose, and unshakeable power. Every battle becomes fuel for your art, your projects, your plans, deeper wisdom for your spirit, and resilience for your temple. That is the core of being UNTAYMAHBLE.)
